! version = 2.0

// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
//  Novadah Sales — persona: konex-sales
//  Retail storefront: product requests, no fictional catalog.
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

! local concat = newline

// ── Persona Identity ─────────────────────────────────────────
! var name    = Novadah Sales
! var persona = sales

// ── Main Topic (includes shared conversation) ────────────────
> topic random includes conversation

  // ── Help ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
  + (help|ede|èd)
  * <get lang> == en => 👋 *Novadah — I can help with:*
  ^ \n
  ^ \n• *request* — ask for a product (we check availability & price)
  ^ \n• *my account* — your info
  ^ \n
  ^ \nOr just tell me what you're looking for!
  - 👋 *Novadah — Mwen ka ede w ak:*
  ^ \n
  ^ \n• *demann* / *request* — mande yon pwodwi (n ap tcheke disponiblite ak pri)
  ^ \n• *kont mwen* / *my account* — enfòmasyon ou
  ^ \n
  ^ \nOswa jis di m sa w ap chèche!

  // ── Product request (replaces the fictional plans/upgrade) ──
  + (request|demann|demand|pwodwi|product|achte|buy|order|kòmand) [*]
  * <get lang> == en => {topic=form_request}What are you looking for? (product, quantity)
  - {topic=form_request}Kisa w ap chèche? (pwodwi, kantite)

  + (plans|plan|forfait|forfè|price|pri|konbyen|combien|promo|pwomosyon|promotion|deal) [*]
  * <get lang> == en => 🛍️ Tell me what product you need and I'll check availability and price for you — type *request* to start.
  - 🛍️ Di m ki pwodwi w bezwen epi n ap tcheke disponiblite ak pri pou ou — ekri *demann* pou kòmanse.

  // ── Account / Profile ──────────────────────────────────────
  + (my|mon) (account|kont|profil|profile)
  @ fetch account

  + show [my] (account|profile)
  @ fetch account

  + (kont|pwofil) mwen
  @ fetch account

  + (show|montre|wè|gade) [kont|pwofil] mwen
  @ fetch account

  + fetch account
  - 📋 *Kont ou:*
  ^ \nNon: <get name>
  ^ \n\nPou plis enfòmasyon, ekri *support*.

  // ── Acknowledgments — emoji reaction (gateway decides if AI override) ──
  + (ok|okay|ok sa|oke|alright|aight|gotcha|bet|cool|nice|lol|haha|mdrrr)
  - {{silent}}

  + (wi|yes|yeah|yep)
  - {{silent}}

  + (no|nah|nope)
  - {{silent}}

  // ── AI Fallback ────────────────────────────────────────────
  + *
  - {{ai_fallback}}

< topic
